  "html": "<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"zh-Hans-CN\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">目录</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#人鱼岛的惨剧-伪书之二_作者：易风\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">人鱼岛的惨剧-伪书之二&nbsp; 作者：易风</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#出牌方法\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">出牌方法</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#故事\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">故事</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#剧作家指南\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">剧作家指南</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h3><span id=\".E4.BA.BA.E9.B1.BC.E5.B2.9B.E7.9A.84.E6.83.A8.E5.89.A7-.E4.BC.AA.E4.B9.A6.E4.B9.8B.E4.BA.8C_.E4.BD.9C.E8.80.85.EF.BC.9A.E6.98.93.E9.A3.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"人鱼岛的惨剧-伪书之二_作者：易风\">人鱼岛的惨剧-伪书之二&nbsp; 作者：易风</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"编辑章节的源代码： 人鱼岛的惨剧-伪书之二&nbsp; 作者：易风\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://tragedyrooper.fandom.com/zh/wiki/BTX-101C%E9%9D%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%A1%A8?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"编辑章节的源代码： 人鱼岛的惨剧-伪书之二&nbsp; 作者：易风\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>规则Y 被封印的邪灵\n</p><p>规则X1 未知因子X\n</p><p>规则X2 潜伏的杀人狂\n</p><p>幻想 邪教徒\n</p><p>黑猫 不安定因子\n</p><p>模仿犯 杀人狂\n</p><p>住院患者 杀人狂\n</p><p>小女孩 主谋\n</p><p>神灵 亲友 3000000000\n</p><p>1 蝴蝶效应 黑猫\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".E5.87.BA.E7.89.8C.E6.96.B9.E6.B3.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"出牌方法\">出牌方法</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"编辑章节的源代码： 出牌方法\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://tragedyrooper.fandom.com/zh/wiki/BTX-101C%E9%9D%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%A1%A8?action=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"编辑章节的源代码： 出牌方法\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>神社：密谋+1\n</p><p>都市：密谋+2\n</p><p>小女孩：不安+1\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".E6.95.85.E4.BA.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"故事\">故事</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"编辑章节的源代码： 故事\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://tragedyrooper.fandom.com/zh/wiki/BTX-101C%E9%9D%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%A1%A8?action=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"编辑章节的源代码： 故事\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>相传，在某个小岛的海湾，有人看见了人鱼，被祝福后获得了永生……\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".E5.89.A7.E4.BD.9C.E5.AE.B6.E6.8C.87.E5.8D.97\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"剧作家指南\">剧作家指南</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"编辑章节的源代码： 剧作家指南\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://tragedyrooper.fandom.com/zh/wiki/BTX-101C%E9%9D%9E%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%A1%A8?action=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"编辑章节的源代码： 剧作家指南\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>此剧本为解密本，除非黑猫已经确定将要死亡，否则剧作家必须优先使用邪教徒的能力阻止神社的禁止密谋\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260927035140\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_zhtragedyrooper:pcache:idhash:1029-0!sseVary=RegularPage!zh!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260927035140 and revision id 2230. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n",
